@startuml import-flow
title TaskView — Import from Trello (sequence)

actor "Org admin" as User
participant "Web\n(ImportWizard)" as Web
participant "Trello" as Trello
participant "API\n(Routes + Controller)" as API
participant "ImportManager" as Mgr
participant "TrelloProvider" as Prov
queue "pg-boss" as Q
participant "ImportApplier" as Applier
participant "CE core\n(Goals / Collaborators / Files)" as Core
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Centrifugo" as Rt

== Connect ==
User -> Web: Choose Trello → Connect
Web -> Trello: popup 1/authorize (scope=read, expiration=1day)
Trello --> Web: /import-callback#token → postMessage to opener
note right of Web: fallback: manual API key + token
Web -> API: POST /jobs {organizationId, provider, credentials}
API -> Mgr: createJob
Mgr -> Prov: validateCredentials
Prov -> Trello: GET /members/me
Mgr -> DB: INSERT import_jobs (draft, credentials encrypted)
API --> Web: job {id}

== Pick board & settings ==
Web -> API: GET /jobs/:id/projects
API -> Prov: listRemoteProjects
Prov -> Trello: GET /members/me/boards
Web -> API: GET /jobs/:id/projects/:boardId
API -> Prov: fetchProjectMeta (people, counts)
User -> Web: options + people → org members mapping

== Start ==
Web -> API: POST /jobs/:id/start {board, options, peopleMapping, locale}
API -> Mgr: start
Mgr -> DB: draft → pending (config saved)
Mgr -> Q: send import-run {jobId}
note right of Mgr: send fails → revertToDraft
API --> Web: job (pending)

== Run (worker) ==
Q -> Applier: run(jobId)
Applier -> DB: pending → running
Applier -> Applier: prepare: re-check org admin,\ndecrypt credentials, createReader
Applier -> Prov: readStructure
Prov -> Trello: board, lists, labels, cards, checklists, comments
Applier -> Core: createGoal (new project)
Applier -> DB: setGoal(goal_id)
Applier -> DB: statuses, lists, tags
Applier -> Core: add mapped members (executor role if new)
loop task batches (parents before children)
  Applier -> Applier: ensureActive (cancelled? still admin?)
  Applier -> DB: tasks, task tags, assignees
  Applier -> Rt: import.progress (≤ 1/s)
  Rt --> Web: progress
end
loop attachments
  Applier -> Prov: downloadAttachment
  Prov -> Trello: GET attachment (OAuth header)
  Applier -> Core: FilesManager.upload
end
Applier -> DB: completed + stats, credentials wiped
Applier -> Rt: import.finished, goals.changed
Rt --> Web: refetch job + history

== Failure / cancel ==
alt tasks not fully written
  Applier -> Core: delete goal
else attachments phase
  Applier -> Applier: keep project, warn on skipped files
end
Applier -> DB: failed | cancelled + error, credentials wiped

== Cleanup (every 30 min) ==
Q -> Applier: import-cleanup (ImportDispatcher)
note right of Applier
  drafts > 24h → delete
  stale pending → expire
  running > 6h10m → interrupted
  (goal deleted if before attachments phase)
end note
@enduml
